      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In this scene focused on angry dad, max finds out that Nastya's dad came looking for Kostya but mistook Max for him and threatened him. Max is terrified. Let's listen closely to Max and Kostya's exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
